WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.173
Notice the urge.

2
00:00:01.293 --> 00:00:02.964
FOMO is fear of missing out.

3
00:00:03.084 --> 00:00:07.067
Revenge trading is trying to win back a loss through another rushed trade.

4
00:00:07.587 --> 00:00:09.433
A fast move is not a plan.

5
00:00:09.553 --> 00:00:12.223
Seeing a price jump can create urgency.

6
00:00:12.343 --> 00:00:14.781
Feeling late does not make an entry suitable.

7
00:00:15.301 --> 00:00:17.008
A loss does not owe you a win.

8
00:00:17.128 --> 00:00:20.785
Increasing size to recover money can make the next loss larger.

9
00:00:21.305 --> 00:00:22.838
Pause before the next click.

10
00:00:22.958 --> 00:00:26.313
Check your planned size, exit, and reason for trading.

11
00:00:26.433 --> 00:00:29.045
Passing on a trade is an available choice.

12
00:00:29.565 --> 00:00:30.575
Track the feeling.

13
00:00:30.695 --> 00:00:32.704
Use Sprout’s mood check-in and journal.

14
00:00:32.824 --> 00:00:36.028
Review your habits rather than judging yourself by one result.

